{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RLSA-2026:97213","published":"2026-11-13T06:06:59.212490Z","modified":"2026-11-13T06:30:04.579110804Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-32280","CVE-2026-33810"],"summary":"Important: grafana-pcp security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"The Grafana plugin for Performance Co-Pilot includes datasources for scalable time series from pmseries and Redis, live PCP metrics and bpftrace scripts from pmdabpftrace, as well as several dashboards.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* crypto/x509: golang: Go crypto/x509: Certificate validation bypass due to incorrect DNS constraint application (CVE-2026-33810)\n\n* crypto/x509: crypto/tls: golang: Go: Denial of Service vulnerability in certificate chain building (CVE-2026-32280)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Update to new grafana-pcp release (JIRA:Rocky Linux-169811)\n\n* [grafana-pcp / rhel-10.3] Remove Lua ExclusiveArch macro for Konflux build (JIRA:Rocky Linux-188288)\n\n* Rebase to grafana-pcp v6.1.0 (JIRA:Rocky Linux-243641)\n\n* grafana-pcp: return a clear error when geomap queries lack latitude/longitude labels (JIRA:Rocky Linux-182453)\n\n* [RFE] Add grafana-pcp dashboards for Rocky Linux AI (JIRA:Rocky Linux-58940)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nAdditional Changes:\n\nFor detailed information on changes in this release, see the Rocky Linux 10 Release Notes linked from the References section.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"grafana-pcp-debuginfo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/grafana-pcp-debuginfo?distro=rocky-linux-10&epoch=0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0:6.1.0-1.el10"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:97213.json"}},{"package":{"name":"grafana-pcp","eco